comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-22T23:50:47.822Z",codex-agent,Fleet CI v2 was delivered by PR #226. This item preserves the branch's three existing completion dates. Those dates differ from the delivering PR merge times and need an orchestrator decision before the merge-time verifier can pass.
  "2026-11-23T00:04:59.214Z",codex-agent,"Focused linked test completed successfully. 11 pass, 0 fail, 0 skipped."
  "2026-11-23T00:07:52.161Z",codex-agent,The focused suite passed 11/11. A scratch Git checkout using main attributes without the closure branch LF pin fails the existing line-ending test at the byte comparison. PR #226 was the Fleet CI v2 delivery and its successful checks include both Linux jobs and the Windows audit. The closure date evidence and the tracker-only file allowlist hold this branch.
  "2026-11-23T00:10:12.782Z",codex-agent,The separate checkout fix is tracked in pm-brief-changelog-lf. The closure-only branch remains held for the completion date discrepancies and file scope.
  "2026-11-23T09:51:26.983Z",codex-agent,"Closure follow-up: closure delivery merge date. Verify against current main and the existing PR head before recording the result."
  "2026-11-23T09:52:48.959Z",codex-agent,"The closure verifier requires completed_at to equal a cited PR merge second. All three existing values are later: option-contract 2026-11-16 20:24:41Z vs PR #218 2026-11-14 16:19:09Z; toolchain 2026-11-16 20:24:35Z vs PR #207 2026-11-05 09:52:35Z; yanp 2026-11-16 20:24:01Z vs PR #192 2026-11-03 14:51:52Z and PR #226 2026-11-15 21:27:22Z. Preserve these items. The inherited LF attribute is required for byte-exact changelog checks on a Git checkout with CRLF conversion. Reverting only the attribute in the Windows-style Git fixture failed the regression."
  "2026-11-23T09:56:49.333Z",codex-agent,"Linked Node tests passed 20/20 with no skips, and the changelog check passed. Final verification will use the committed branch. CI checks for the closure follow-up are tracked at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/228/checks."
  "2026-11-23T16:12:55.211Z",codex-agent,Correct delivery timestamps on 3 terminal records using GitHub merge data and pinned PM. Preserve closed status and append evidence to each item. The previously verified Windows LF fix remains an allowlist hold.
  "2026-11-23T16:19:24.332Z",codex-agent,"The registered focused Node tests and changelog check passed. Identity, public-content and history prefix checks are part of the final-head gate. The full release gate runs in package CI."
  "2026-11-23T22:31:45.910Z",codex-agent,Moved the Windows changelog checkout work to the standalone fix branch. Restored the bounded-window fixture attribution to v2026.11.04 and verified the separate Fleet CI v2 merge evidence. Compare the dependency notes with and without the generator opt-in.
  "2026-11-23T22:38:37.759Z",codex-agent,Generated both forms with the pinned tool. The default invocation loses dependency bullets in 2026.11.11 and 2026.11.15. The explicit --dependency-updates invocation keeps every published dependency bullet and the release-pinned tracker entries. The package-script follow-up is pm-brief-changelog-dependency-updates. Hold closure PR #228 until the package opts in.
